  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One Stop Shop for Green Energy Investments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims to boost private investments in green energy by offering a credible and skilled platform (One-Stop-Shop; OSS) bringing together finance providers and finance seekers (investors) so as to facilitate and scale up clean energy investment projects. The One-Stop-Shop will thus act as a single access point to European support and financing instruments which promote clean energy solutions in Sub-Saharan Africa&amp;nbsp;</narrative>
  </description>
